{"path":"error/tx_exception","title":"std::tx_exception","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>tx_exception","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/error/tx_exception","section":"error","kind":"page","summary":"Defines an exception type that can be used to cancel and roll back an atomic transaction initiated by the keyword atomic_cancel.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/stdexcept\">&lt;stdexcept&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-tm_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> tx_exception <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"kw1\">public</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/runtime_error\"><span class=\"kw774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">runtime_error</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-tm-ts t-mark-ts\">(TM TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Defines an exception type that can be used to cancel and roll back an atomic transaction initiated by the keyword <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/transactional_memory\"><code>atomic_cancel</code></a>.\n</p><p>If <code>T</code> is not <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/TriviallyCopyable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">TriviallyCopyable</em></a>, the program that specializes <code>std::tx_exception&lt;T&gt;</code> is ill-formed.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::tx_exception::tx_exception\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::tx_exception::</span>tx_exception</h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-tm_ts\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div>