></code> as explanatory string that can be accessed through <span class=\"t-lc\">what()</span> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> as the object that can be accessed through <span class=\"t-lc\">get()</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Copy constructor. If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> both have dynamic type <code>std::tx_exception&lt;T&gt;</code> then <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strcmp\"><span class=\"kw1154\">std::<span class=\"me2\">strcmp</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>what<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, other.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> payload object\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> what_arg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> explanatory string\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> another exception object to copy\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1-3)</span> May throw implementation-defined exceptions.\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"t-member\">\n<h2 id=\"std::tx_exception::operator.3D\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::tx_exception::</span>operator=</h2>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-tm_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">tx_exception<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> tx_excepti